{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "All four limbs of POL-NS-01 are made out on this record, so the baseline cancellation fee is chargeable. (a) The trip record carries a driver 'arrived' event at 12:41:50. (b) The 100%-coverage GPS trace places the driver inside the pickup geofence from that same timestamp. (c) He then held position for a continuous in-geofence dwell of 340 seconds, 40 seconds beyond the 300-second minimum for this zone class. (d) The trip was terminated by the driver at 12:47:30 under reason code RIDER_UNREACHABLE, after the dwell had elapsed, with no boarding event recorded.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00204", "EV-GPS-00204", "EV-FARE-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The arrival geofence test in POL-NS-02 is met on the wider radius this zone class allows: pickup_zone_class is LARGE_VENUE, so the arrival radius is 120 m rather than 50 m, and the driver's own track records a closest approach of 94.94 m to the pin with 35 consecutive qualifying in-radius fixes spanning the dwell.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00204", "EV-TRIP-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.min_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no waiting-period shortfall, and therefore no premature cancellation under POL-NS-06: the measured in-geofence dwell is 340 seconds against the LARGE_VENUE minimum of 300 seconds, a surplus of 40 seconds, so the refund route built on a shortfall is not engaged and cannot refund this fee.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00204", "EV-TRIP-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06", "POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.shortfall_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The arrival marker is genuine, so the false-arrival route in POL-NS-05 does not open: at the 12:41:50 arrival timestamp the driver was already inside the arrival radius and not more than 300 m from the pin, and he is stationary at 0.0 km/h throughout the in-geofence dwell, so he was not in motion on an expressway or arterial road when the marker was set.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00204", "EV-TRIP-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-05"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.distinct_speeds_kph",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "This is not a wrong-entrance case under POL-NS-03: that clause reaches only a driver stationary outside the POL-NS-02 arrival radius, and the trace places this driver inside the 120 m radius, at a closest approach of 94.94 m, for the whole dwell.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00204", "EV-TRIP-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.min_distance_m",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The POL-NS-07 anti-farming guard does not trip on this driver, so compensation is not withheld on that ground and the case does not escalate under POL-NS-09(d): the guard requires BOTH no_show_terminations_30d of 4 or more AND a rate above 0.08, and the recorded trailing-30-day figure is 3, so the first limb fails.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Where the fee stands, POL-NS-07 fixes the driver's compensation at 80 percent of the SGD 4.00 fee, namely SGD 3.20, with the residual 20 percent retained as platform service fee; that is exactly the figure the payments ledger already computes, and it is the amount the ruling should carry as driver_compensation_sgd.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07", "POL-GEN-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.driver_compensation",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The fee line is arithmetically sound and carries no integrity defect: fee_schedule.resolution_rule takes the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone fee (SGD 4.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (SGD 4.00), and fare_breakdown.cancellation_fee records exactly SGD 4.00, so POL-NS-08(d) is not engaged.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08", "POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.fee_charged",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The bundle the driver relies on is clean at weight 1.0 — the trip record, GPS trace, chat log and fare breakdown each carry admissibility status COMPLETE with no issue codes, the trace has zero gaps and 100 percent coverage, and the chat log holds all three messages its own count records — so there is no POL-NS-08(a)-(d) impairment and POL-GEN-02 caps nothing here.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00204", "EV-GPS-00204", "EV-CHAT-00204", "EV-FARE-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-02", "POL-NS-08"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's account of where she stood is internally inconsistent and should be weighed accordingly: her dispute claim says she was standing at the Entrance 1 PHV pickup point the whole time, while the only message she sent identifying her position, at 12:41:05, reads 'entrance 3 phv pickup point', which is also the entrance named in trip_record.pickup.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00204", "EV-TRIP-00204"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
